ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nThe Wang family has 3 sons and 2 daughters. The eldest son, Xiao Ming, after careful consideration and consultation with his parents, decides to pause his career, return home to take care of his father who suffers from a long-term illness, and start a business in his hometown. But his brothers and sisters are very selfish. Mr. Wang knows this is a big sacrifice for Xiao Ming's career development.\n\n[Question]\nMr. Wang should be moved by Xiao Ming's decision, but in fact, he appears angry, why?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Mr. Wang is angry at Xiao Ming's decision to give up his career, thinking he should focus on his future.\nB. Mr. Wang is angry that Xiao Ming's brothers and sisters do not make the same effort and sacrifice for the family.\nC. Mr. Wang is angry that Xiao Ming makes this important decision without consulting him in advance.\nD. Mr. Wang is angry at the medical system, because he thinks they do not provide him with enough support.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0024725462335760404,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e239d6006945d2801d50","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368057764,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:34:17","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"cc2f6835e82d416299c27148fada8713"}